## ABS

Source: https://github.com/LeCAR-Lab/ABS
Authors: Tairan He, Chong Zhang, Wenli Xiao, Guanqi He, Changliu Liu, Guanya Shi.
License: CC BY-NC 4.0, with inherited Legged Gym and RSL-RL licenses.

This repository adapts ABS navigation from Isaac Gym to IsaacLab, modifies its
RSL-RL training components (source/loco_rl/) and selected navigation rewards
(source/assets/mdp/rewards.py and reward_math.py), and adds the VOP-Net workflow,
data collection, evaluation, and visualization. This is an unofficial adaptation.
Source comparison baseline (not necessarily the original import revision):
https://github.com/LeCAR-Lab/ABS/tree/9b95329ffb823c15dead02be620ff96938e4d0a3

